Hi, Sim

I think the Rgraphviz error is Graphviz installation failure. Some files
relative to Graphviz are not there. You might be able to get helps at
Graphviz or Ubuntu mailing list about this issue. But I think one option is
switching your ubuntu 8.04 to 9.04 or 9.10. Graphviz and Rgraphviz work very
well on both platform, even the Remix version.

Best

Gilbert

