Hi Richie,

I am not sure which data set and annotation package you are working  
on, taking hgu133plus2 chip for example. if you just want to get  
Entrez genes corresponding to your probesets, you can simply do:

library("hgu133plus2.db")
entrezIDs<-unlist(mget(probesets, hgu133plus2ENTREZID))
entrezIDs<-entrezIDs[!is.na(entrezIDs) & !duplicated(entrezIDs)]

Hope it is what you want.

Cheers,
Yuan



